# Regenerated by `npm run build` — bundling third-party code into the repo
# would put ~2 MB of vendored JavaScript under version control for a spike
# whose output is a decision document.
vendor/
node_modules/

# The probe copies the renderer in at build time; the originals are the
# committed copies one directory up.
wasm-probe/wwwroot/viz/renderer-svg.js
wasm-probe/wwwroot/viz/family-graph.js
wasm-probe/wwwroot/viz/harness.css
wasm-probe/wwwroot/viz/candidates/

# Screenshots are regenerated by `node measure.mjs` and `node capture-detail.mjs`.
# The four `-small` comparisons and the WASM probe shot are the evidence the ADR
# cites, so those are committed; the rest are not worth the repository weight.
results/*.png
!results/hand-small.png
!results/dagre-small.png
!results/d3dag-small.png
!results/cytoscape-small.png
!results/wasm-probe.png
